# Codigrate Roraima
#
# Category: Nature
#
# Description:
# Inspired by the sunset over Mount Roraima and the slow turn from day to night on its tabletop summit, this theme blends deep brown and clay shadows with amber, gold, and salmon accents to create a soothing yet vivid coding environment. Dark, earthy backgrounds ground the editor, while soft violets and mineral yellows add contrast and focus to key syntax elements.
#
# For more information about the color theory behind:
# https://codigrate.com

# --- Interface colors ---

# Background uses editorBackground first because Ghostty is a reading surface.
background = #1E1A1B
foreground = #D0CCCD

selection-background = #562F2F
selection-foreground = #D0CCCD

cursor-color = #DF6F50
cursor-text = #171415

# --- ANSI 16-color palette ---
# ANSI colors are mapped directly from fixed JetBrains semantic fields.
# Bright ANSI colors are slightly brighter versions of the base ANSI colors.

